# Step 3 of the guide, way C. Install with: crontab -e (as the user that owns the folder).
# Change /home/sdr/ai-sdr to the folder where you cloned your copy of the template.
#
# The sign-up flow: no model inside, every 2 hours, at minute 5.
# A dry run is a practice run: it reads sample data and changes nothing. The line below starts as a dry run.
# Change DRY_RUN=1 to DRY_RUN=0 after you have read the first output. Then it writes and sends.
5 */2 * * * cd /home/sdr/ai-sdr && DRY_RUN=1 node engine/way-c-scripts/signup-flow.mjs >> runs/signup-flow.log 2>&1

# The daily check (step 6), once a day at 07:15. Change DRY_RUN=1 to DRY_RUN=0 after you have read the first output.
15 7 * * * cd /home/sdr/ai-sdr && DRY_RUN=1 node scripts/daily-check.mjs >> runs/daily-check.log 2>&1
